  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish contribution to the Trust Fund in Support of Political Affairs through the Multi-Year appeal of the UN Department of Political and Peacebuilding Affairs is expected to supporting the Department to leveage its capacities for prevention and improve its support to Member States in upholding international peace and security. It is a part of realising the strategic partnership and Denmark&apos;s organisation strategy for support to UN efforts towards sustaining peace and preventing violent conflicts.</narrative>
  </description>
